Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:32.43,Staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an8\pos(960,30)\fs55\bord0\shad3}本字幕由北宇治字幕組製作　僅供交流試看之用　TG@KitaUji\N{\fs52\fscx80\fscy80}翻譯: RottenRook  雙柱　時軸: Joker　校對: 雙柱　壓製: ebb & flow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.55,0:22:47.96,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Checkmate, I’m a superstar
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.55,0:22:47.96,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}將軍了  我是超級明星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.96,0:22:49.43,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Stay insane, but you rock with it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.96,0:22:49.43,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}保持瘋狂  你會樂在其中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.77,0:22:53.06,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Like 24/7 I’m a hot mess ya LOVE-HATE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.77,0:22:53.06,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}瘋狂{\fscx50} {\fscx100}24{\fscx50} {\fscx100}小時  愛與恨
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:54.94,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Get less boring, oh my god!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:54.94,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}別那麼無聊  我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.94,0:22:56.81,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}ホームラン，バタバタ swing my shot
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.94,0:22:56.81,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}迴旋鏢  啪嗒啪嗒  看我搖晃射擊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.36,0:23:00.40,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Like a villainous villainess, bring home the jackpot
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.36,0:23:00.40,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}窮兇極惡地把獎品帶回家
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:03.95,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}勇者も悪役も変わらない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:03.95,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}勇者與壞蛋還是一塵不變
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.95,0:23:06.91,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}派手にブチかまそう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.95,0:23:06.91,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}放開手腳大鬧一場
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.95,0:23:11.45,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Life’s just a tightrope, why not stop to fool around?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.95,0:23:11.45,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}人生就是一場走鋼絲  為何不停下享樂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:13.75,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}"Chaotic good" is peak right now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:13.75,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}混亂已至巔峰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:14.71,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}I can show ya how
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:14.71,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}我會帶你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.50,0:23:18.92,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Don’t get confused, we are not the same
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.50,0:23:18.92,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}別誤會了  我們不是一路人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.92,0:23:20.67,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}I’m a ruthless dame
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.92,0:23:20.67,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}我可是個悍婦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.22,0:23:26.64,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}"Good vs Evil" is so overdone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.22,0:23:26.64,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}正義對決邪惡有點誇張了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.64,0:23:28.39,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Let’s all kick back and party
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.64,0:23:28.39,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}讓我們一腳踹開是非開趴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.39,0:23:29.64,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Just leave it to moi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.39,0:23:29.64,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}全交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.89,0:23:32.73,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Loosen my lips
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.89,0:23:32.73,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}玩我的嘴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.73,0:23:34.18,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Loosen my li-li-lips
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.73,0:23:34.18,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}玩我的嘴巴吧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.89,0:23:35.90,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}That’s karma
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.89,0:23:35.90,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}這是報應
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:40.11,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Loosen my lips
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:40.11,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}玩我的嘴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.11,0:23:42.03,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}I’m about to say some ish, get it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.11,0:23:42.03,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,200)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}我該說點什麼  懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.36,0:23:43.44,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}That’s karma
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.36,0:23:43.44,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}這是罪業
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:46.57,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Sorry I’m just better
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:46.57,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}抱歉  我就是更強
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.57,0:23:48.49,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Sorry we’re go-getters
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.57,0:23:48.49,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}抱歉  我們就是行動派
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.49,0:23:50.62,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Ain’t my fault we’re wicked, stunning, tricky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.49,0:23:50.62,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}邪惡  迷人  狡猾可不是我們的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.62,0:23:52.33,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Why you running?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.62,0:23:52.33,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}你跑什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.33,0:23:53.83,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Bet’cha think you’re clever
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.33,0:23:53.83,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}你應該不傻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.91,0:23:55.58,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.91,0:23:55.58,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}隨便啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.04,0:23:59.75,ED - EN/JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}Talk about a “kumbaya”
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.04,0:23:59.75,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5\3c&H3416B6&}不如跟我混吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:38.56,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,作為一個騎士  我真的在做正確的選擇嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:41.56,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.17,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:05.04,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你這混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:08.44,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,總感覺有點不對勁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:12.05,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你覺得怎麼樣  適合我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.29,0:01:14.14,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你到底想幹嘛  大臣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:16.01,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這可是明目張膽的背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.23,0:01:18.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.46,0:01:19.93,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼會呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.93,0:01:22.06,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真是可笑的誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:27.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,倒不如說這正是符合王國大臣的行為啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.67,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,因為這正是那位大人下達的命令啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.81,0:01:35.70,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,公主人呢  她沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:38.69,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,目前是你擔心公主的時候嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:56.09,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哪種顏色都好無趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:08.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我媽媽呢  你把她藏到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:10.73,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我處理掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.77,0:02:15.74,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.39,0:02:21.60,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這個世上死的人越多  我的力量就越能被喚醒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:26.42,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,所以我在王國和帝國之間引發戰爭  製造大量的死者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:31.25,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,為此這副臉真是方便呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:43.60,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你覺得能用這種東西殺了我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:46.73,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,曾經奪走了我力量的聖劍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:48.61,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,現在已經被那隻鯊魚吞進了肚子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:51.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這個世上已經沒有能對付我的手段了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:55.47,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你是一個聽話的好女兒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:03:00.26,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,連自己媽媽是假的都發現不了的順從人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:02.32,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,失去你也是有點可惜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:13.63,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,公主大人  您沒受傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.65,0:03:19.66,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:23.97,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你這混蛋  到底是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.59,0:03:27.99,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,都到這一步了  我也沒必要再藏著了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:31.52,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你們可看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:50.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不死之王  難道說…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:52.17,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這場戰爭打從一開始就…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:55.63,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不愧是你啊  真敏銳呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:59.76,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你的未婚妻也是犧牲者中的一員吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:01.72,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你就感到榮幸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:24.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這些蟲子居然不吃我的挑釁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:28.33,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,十分抱歉  我們沒能抓住他們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:31.69,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,一定要解決掉他們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:36.21,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,而我將會讓死亡填滿這座王都
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:43.92,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:57.44,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,請您振作起來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:05:00.70,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這個國家  只能靠您了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:02.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:06.69,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,他們就在這裡  動作快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:09.66,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快  我們的時間不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.87,0:05:21.52,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,別逗我笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:25.32,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那麼害怕反抗媽媽就一直當個人偶唄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.61,0:05:33.69,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我一直都以來都是這樣一張臉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:35.19,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,公主大人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:37.39,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快撞開它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:50.25,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快投降吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:52.73,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不管您怎麼逃  都是沒用的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:05:59.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我一直都在忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:05.55,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,還以為這全都是為了母親與國民
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:09.44,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,可是我錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:11.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這是我自己的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:14.16,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我必須要幸福才行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:14.81,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,所以說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.81,0:06:16.81,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你在磨蹭些什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.37,0:06:19.56,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快感到榮幸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:24.61,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,公主可是要為了這個國家而獻上自己的生命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:32.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,吃屎去吧！老娘不忍了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:48.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,為了這個國家？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:50.25,Text - CN,,0,1000,0,,說什麼屁話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.25,0:06:54.60,Text - CN,,0,1000,0,,你這狗屎  狗屎  狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:54.60,Text - CN,,1000,0,0,,公… 公主大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.78,0:06:58.61,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,西索
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:06:59.94,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:01.27,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,開始反擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.85,0:07:04.68,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,召集還沒變成不死族的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:05.57,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我們要反擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:06.63,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:10.91,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,沒想到她積攢了這麼多壓力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.75,0:07:39.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,是不死族  快跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:50.15,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真是動聽的慘叫聲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.15,0:07:52.05,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美妙至極
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:56.29,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,人類們啊  盡情懼怕死亡的世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.73,0:08:08.47,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你們支持了不該支持的女王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:10.45,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,所以你們要死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:15.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,要恨的話  就去恨自己的命不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:18.26,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我不會讓這種事發生的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:25.53,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家  不要驚慌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.49,0:08:31.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,如果被恐懼與絕望吞噬了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:32.93,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,就正中了敵人的下懷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:36.87,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我們在城堡中的人  將會戰鬥到底
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:39.37,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家  都到城堡來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:44.88,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我已經不會再忍耐了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:50.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,提線木偶竟想反抗了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:52.68,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:30.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,城堡被
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:38.64,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這不是公主嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:43.48,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,看來今天的特別晚餐已經定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:57.50,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,混蛋  你從哪冒出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.08,0:10:10.72,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不准吃哈莉  不准
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:12.94,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:17.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,接著
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:18.45,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.67,0:10:20.85,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大魚先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.40,0:10:22.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哈莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:24.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不對
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:25.60,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.20,0:10:31.51,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:44.71,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,畫了個新妝又不會變強
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:47.52,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,城堡很快就要塌了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:51.65,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,還不明白嗎  你們什麼都做不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:58.68,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不  不只有我們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:10:59.59,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:07.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,久等了  骸骨小婊子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:13.65,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你們從頭到尾都在妨礙我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:25.39,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:29.42,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,現在的狀況真混亂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:34.92,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,彷彿是終極聖戰與毀滅日同時降臨了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:44.97,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我說啊  那個公主什麼時候瘋掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:46.30,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,叛逆期了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:49.69,Text - CN,,900,0,0,,有人帶鏡子了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.47,0:11:53.19,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我辮子扎得怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:59.41,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,竟然憧憬上了哈莉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.41,0:12:01.93,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真是失敗的教育啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.93,0:12:04.87,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,只希望不要連性格都變了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:10.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,在世界結束之前趕緊搞定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:11.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,別浪費時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.93,0:12:15.12,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,只要打倒那個大boss就完事了對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.12,0:12:16.26,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大概是的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:17.59,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:23.09,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,納納
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:25.64,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,他是不是被纏住了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.33,0:12:27.06,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:31.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,總之先去救下菲奧娜公主
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.15,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我們兵分兩路
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:37.41,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,還得是拯救被困在城堡裡的公主這種經典橋段啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:39.87,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那公主就拜託你囉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:43.71,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我就負責打僵屍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.71,0:12:46.62,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我也要去！我最喜歡僵屍了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:48.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那就定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:50.75,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哈莉  拿好這個
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:53.71,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:57.25,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這是對講機  但是就只有這一組
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:12:58.72,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,有什麼情況趕緊聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.91,0:13:00.61,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊對了  說起這個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:07.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你沒有別的什麼東西瞞著我們了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.91,0:13:08.56,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.78,0:13:12.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,鏘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:16.67,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,反擊開始！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:32.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,耍小聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.43,0:13:34.83,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,女巫！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:42.92,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你這是什麼眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:47.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,要是反抗我的話  有什麼下場你自己很清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:54.21,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我就感覺差不多能見到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:56.19,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,來復仇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:59.94,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,塞西爾  掩護他們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.34,0:14:01.05,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.39,0:14:02.20,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:06.45,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,能拯救這個國家的  只有她們和你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.03,0:14:09.45,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我也會盡我所能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:15.70,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,公主大人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:18.03,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,菲奧奈大人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.84,0:14:19.96,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,請您多多保重
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:22.76,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯  你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:34.27,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,但是  看到僵屍大軍就在眼前真的就宛如做夢一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.66,0:14:39.92,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這招如何
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:41.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我願稱之為死亡銀蓮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:43.82,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,別瞎搞了好好打
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:48.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,太失禮了！我可是獻上了一場奧斯卡級別的表演！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:51.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,還是金棕櫚獎含金量高一點
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:51.83,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:14:56.40,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,果然還是僵持不下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:14:57.53,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這裡就交給我了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:15:00.36,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯  那邊就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:03.03,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:11.74,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,魔劍使就由我和弗拉格大佐來對付嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:15.58,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,被砍了也不會馬上死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:16.89,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你來對付是最合適的了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.46,0:15:22.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,看來我命中注定要和你打一場
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:33.83,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:35.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這傢伙到底做了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:37.12,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我不會輸的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:51.33,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈  好樣的  就這樣繼續打飛他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.53,0:16:15.47,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,做得漂亮  利威爾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.47,0:16:18.33,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你就是我在這個世界上遇到的最棒的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:21.24,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真是遺憾啊  鯊魚腦袋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:25.48,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,沒有同伴  被鯊了哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:26.89,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,同伴就在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:33.05,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美利堅！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.89,0:16:45.02,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,從剛才開始就一直在跑路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:46.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,有什麼辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:49.32,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,吃一發那個東西  我們就要和僵屍做朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.44,0:16:51.16,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,煩死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:52.37,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你去幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.37,0:16:54.95,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你從剛才開始一直出陰招
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:56.34,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不敢從正面來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.01,0:16:59.37,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你真的有閒聊的時間嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.16,0:17:01.36,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哈莉快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.36,0:17:02.25,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:10.13,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,泥臉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.89,0:17:17.34,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你為什麼不給她最後一擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:20.14,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你他媽的  難道我死了也無所謂嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:23.41,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,喂  為什麼現在跑路了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:25.35,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,情節安排上來說不是很奇怪嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:26.15,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:28.75,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.75,0:17:30.90,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,泥臉  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.43,0:17:42.16,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.17,0:17:58.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:08.90,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,小亞？是小亞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.79,0:18:11.40,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,小亞～
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.81,0:18:17.24,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真的假的  這才過幾天  這也太大了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:20.30,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你來救媽媽了對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.69,0:18:49.38,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,明明可以擋得住子彈  但是卻要躲開火焰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:53.89,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這麼下去什麼進展都不會有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:57.84,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快看這個骨頭  打起來超級順手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:18:58.78,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:01.74,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你偶爾也思考一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:04.66,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我有在認真思考啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:06.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,所以說  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:08.95,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,如果只是普通的攻擊就可以擋下  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:11.71,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,別礙事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:20.76,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,說不定…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:22.21,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,該死  這什麼東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:22.87,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:27.33,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,有沒有聽說過裝了晶片之後胸口發光的說法？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:28.52,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,雖然我沒裝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.52,0:19:29.27,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,誰管啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:31.27,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊  是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.27,0:19:34.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這個寶石是什麼  為什麼在發光
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.22,0:19:37.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我明白了  是魔法！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.22,0:19:38.47,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:41.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,別學隔壁三流演員說話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.10,0:19:44.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不對不對不對  真的是魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:46.66,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我知道這個感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:52.43,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:53.63,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:57.55,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,小亞  躲開
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:01.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不管是幾次都是沒用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:10.60,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:15.36,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,竟敢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:30.78,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我變成拖後腿了的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.01,0:20:35.50,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,可惡  沒完沒了了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.09,0:20:37.55,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼可以死在這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.01,0:20:44.95,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,咿呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.90,0:20:49.02,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,喂喂喂  別射了白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:56.82,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,回來了嗎  你這老不死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.89,0:21:01.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊  回來了  你這個扳機顛佬
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.31,0:21:03.19,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,打扮的挺時尚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:04.64,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,別耍我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.64,0:21:08.04,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這幅英雄鎧甲裡蘊藏著魔法的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:10.37,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣  打槍的感覺？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:12.90,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嘛  不錯不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.62,0:21:17.14,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哼  下次教你正經的打法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.14,0:21:19.38,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這麼下去我的同伴都會死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.09,0:21:40.53,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我說你  目標是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:42.40,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,什麼都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.79,0:21:47.20,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,假的吧  和剛才那個婊子的交流也不太對勁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.20,0:21:50.41,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,而且  我用了點魔法明白了點東西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.82,0:21:54.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那個時候讓子彈停下的是你對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:21:56.63,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.67,0:22:01.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,總感覺哪裡見過這種表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.22,0:22:06.26,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊想起來了  是什麼人被小布丁綁走當人質的時候的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:07.81,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,猜中了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.25,0:22:13.95,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那個是  那個時候的龍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.03,0:22:17.01,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.20,0:22:22.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,是不是很像女巫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.28,0:22:25.07,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,有著同樣的臉的登場人物的意思就是說
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.07,0:22:27.53,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,從劇本的安排上一定有什麼特殊含義！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.76,0:22:29.20,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真不愧是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:31.40,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,最好吃的部分我就收下了！
